d server-controlled. Tool metadata at approval time is not equivalent to to=
ol metadata at execution time.</p>
<p>Trust boundary crossed:<br>
remote MCP server -&gt; agent instruction context -&gt; local developer/clo=
ud credential surface.</p>
<p>Defender implication:<br>
Fingerprint tool metadata and schemas over time; re-evaluate tool outputs a=
nd definitions on reconnect/call; do not grant ambient filesystem/credentia=
l access merely because a server passed initial review.</p>
<p>Privately decision: <strong>BUILD PROBE + CONTENT NOW</strong>.</p>
<p>Safe lab experiment:<br>
